# The agent workspace is PRIVATE BY DEFAULT.
# Everything is ignored unless explicitly whitelisted below — so personal
# content (documents, logs, archives) can never end up on GitHub.
#
# Tracked = the shippable agent scaffold (templates/, folder READMEs). Private =
# everything the agent and user create from it, including your own CLAUDE.md
# (copied from templates/CLAUDE.md on setup, then yours to edit).
*

# --- Tracked structure & templates -----------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!.mcp.json

!templates/
!templates/**

# CLAUDE.md is intentionally NOT whitelisted: the base lives at
# templates/CLAUDE.md; your working copy here stays private.

!documents/
documents/*
!documents/README.md

!logs/
logs/*
!logs/README.md

!archive/
archive/*
!archive/README.md
